From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:09:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Organiser stats page at /stats (share-code gated)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A private, shareable read-out for whoever ran the event:
- Each event gets an auto-generated share code (Admin → event editor → Organiser
  stats link, with a copy-ready URL). The organiser opens /stats?event=&key=…
  and sees it without any admin access.
- New public /api/stats validates the code against the event's statsCode and
  returns totals (free coffees/cups, unique guests, paid sales, app-vs-counter),
  a per-booth breakdown, and the full guest list (name + mobile + booth + time).
- Refactored the guest aggregation into aggregateEventStats(), shared by the
  admin guest log and the new page. StatsPage.jsx renders standalone (no app
  chrome); main.jsx routes /stats to it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0187Jj4Q77V4UPawzEh9gsGr
